    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>A demilich is a skull that holds what remains of a lich’s evil essence. When the weight of immortality overwhelms a lich, its mind turns inward while its body crumbles away, but if its remains are disturbed, a demilich awakens. Demiliches usually look like skulls set with gems or carved with arcane symbols.</p>",
